    title: 'The Logic of the Feeling Body: Susanne Langer, Feeling, and the Philosophy of Symbolic Transformation',
    subject: 'Philosophy of Art and Symbolic Form',
    subtitle: 'What if art is not decoration, entertainment, or self-expression — but the only language precise enough to articulate the inner life of a conscious being?',
